<title>FRANCE: Promodes ups stake in Gruppo G to 80 pct.</title>
<headline>Promodes ups stake in Gruppo G to 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>French retailer Promodes said on Tuesday it had raised its stake in Italian hyper and supermarket Gruppo G to 80 percent from 34.5 percent.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the move followed an agreement with Garosci, of which Gruppo G is the parent holding company.</p>
</text>
